                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238523144",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198019154456",
                            "num_reviews": 20,
                            "playtime_forever": 149,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 149,
                            "playtime_at_review": 149,
                            "last_played": 1792916202
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A good game, I like the puzzles, difficult enough to be engaging, but not so difficult as to be frustrating.  But one major flaw was that it would not let me exit the game properly.  In order to exit, I had to tell Steam to stop it, and that forces it closed without saving.  So in order to get to all the puzzles, I had to play it all in one session.  This is also likely what results in not getting the Steam achievement for finishing the game.  So that was frustrating.  I see others have posted that in order to finish properly, you need to go download the previous version of the game.  If I ever decide to play it again, I will likely do that.  If you don't care about the one achievement though, or saving progress, it is still good.",
